294
00:20:58,320 --> 00:21:01,950
All right, well, that's good to know. Good night, Steve.
好的，那就這樣，晚安，史提夫

295
00:21:11,770 --> 00:21:14,670
- Hey, what's wrong? - I just had a rough night.
-嘿，怎麼了？ -我剛度過糟糕的一晚

296
00:21:15,270 --> 00:21:17,000
Crab cake?
要蟹肉餅嗎？

297
00:21:18,740 --> 00:21:20,500
Well, what happened?
發生什麼事了？

298
00:21:20,710 --> 00:21:23,440
This is kind of weird to talk to you about this, but..
跟你聊這件事真的是有點奇怪 但是…

299
00:21:23,610 --> 00:21:25,700
Monica told me you had a blind date.
摩妮卡跟我說你去約會了

300
00:21:25,880 --> 00:21:28,750
- Yeah. - I did too.
-是啊 -我也是

301
00:21:28,920 --> 00:21:33,110
But is it technically a date if the other person doesn't show up?
但是如果對方沒有出現 那到底算不算是約會呢？

302
00:21:34,690 --> 00:21:38,490
Oh, no. Do you think she walked in, saw you and left?
喔，你覺得是她看到你 然後就走了嗎？

303
00:21:42,030 --> 00:21:44,430
Why does everyone keep saying that?
為什麼大家要一直這樣說呢？

304
00:21:45,270 --> 00:21:48,700
