309
00:21:59,610 --> 00:22:02,450
"Female Body Inspector"?
「女性身體檢查官」？

310
00:22:03,520 --> 00:22:06,110
What size is that?
這是什麼尺寸的？

311
00:22:07,390 --> 00:22:10,980
Now wait a minute. So they're gonna name their first child Joey?
等等，所以他們要把 第一個孩子取名喬伊？

312
00:22:11,160 --> 00:22:13,890
How do I get them to name the next one after me?
那我要怎樣才能讓他們 把第二個孩子以我的名字取名呢？

313
00:22:14,060 --> 00:22:17,050
It's easy. You just walk in on them having sex.
很簡單，你只要在 他們做愛時走進去就行了

314
00:22:18,030 --> 00:22:21,230
Oh, so they owe me, like, three Phoebes.
喔，所以他們已經欠我三個菲比了

315
00:22:22,040 --> 00:22:24,900
Oh, my God! Look, it's Ross and Rachel!
我的天！瞧，那是羅斯跟瑞秋

316
00:22:25,110 --> 00:22:26,770
The plan is working!
計劃奏效了

317
00:22:28,080 --> 00:22:30,670
Don't do the plan laugh.
別再做那個計劃成功之笑了

318
00:22:31,750 --> 00:22:35,810
The first dates we've had in months, and they were both such disasters.
我們幾個月以來的第一次約會 而結果卻這麼慘

319
00:22:37,980 --> 00:22:39,920
You know, it is weird..
你知道，真是奇怪…

320
00:22:40,090 --> 00:22:44,520
that Phoebe would set me up on a date that was awful..
菲比幫我安排一個很爛的約會

321
00:22:44,690 --> 00:22:49,290
on the same night Joey set you up on a date that didn't even show.
而在同一晚，喬伊幫你安排了一個 根本沒有人出現的約會

322
00:22:50,160 --> 00:22:52,530
Wait a minute.
等一下

323
00:22:52,700 --> 00:22:55,670
You don't think it was intentional?
你不會認為這是故意的吧

324
00:22:55,840 --> 00:22:58,360
I mean, that's just stupid.
我是說，這實在太愚蠢了

325
00:22:58,610 --> 00:23:00,700
We're geniuses.
我們真是天才

326
00:23:01,810 --> 00:23:06,800
- Look at them! They're really bonding. - They're falling in love all over again.
-瞧瞧他們！合得不得了 -再度墜入愛河了

327
00:23:08,620 --> 00:23:11,180
Oh, they see us. Oh, they look mad.
喔，他們看到我們了，看起來很生氣

328
00:23:13,090 --> 00:23:15,350
They figured it out. They're coming. Run!
他們知道了，他們過來了，快跑！

329
00:23:15,520 --> 00:23:17,650
